---
/**
 * Standard estimate disclaimer. Rendered on every calculator page.
 * Deliberately subtle — informative without dominating the page.
 */
---

<aside
  aria-label="Calculator disclaimer"
  class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100/70 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600"
>
  <p>
    <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Estimates only.</strong>
    Lottery winnings and tax treatment can vary by lottery, jurisdiction, tax year, and
    individual circumstances. Results shown by this calculator are estimates for
    informational purposes only and are not tax, legal, or financial advice.
  </p>
</aside>
